<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82393" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτρέφω</span></b> , pf. -<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτροφα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.738
				</span></i>
			 :—<i>cause, make to congeal around</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάχνην</span> l.c.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλγος π. κραδίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					299
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτρέφεται κυκόωντι</span>
			[the milk] <i>forms curds</i> as you mix it, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.903
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σακέεσσι περιτρέφετο
			κρύσταλλος</span> the ice <i>froze hard upon</i> the shields,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.477
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ περιτεθραμμένον σοι σαρκίδιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					12.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.504
			</span></i>.</div>
